rnen.\u0022,\u0022triggerRequirementIds\u0022:[\u0022chat:mini-sweep-test#1\u0022],\u0022targetRequirementId\u0022:null,\u0022targetFeatureId\u0022:null}]"},"toolStep":2,"timestampUtc":"2026-08-09T10:24:24.712526Z"}
